-- * Request Sat Range Residuals                                              *
-- *                                                                          *
-- * Message name:    CmndReqSatRangeResiduals                                *
-- * Message ID:      6433                                                    *
-- * Message status:  Optional(2)                                             *
-- * Frequency:       As required                                             *
-- * Input/Output:    Input/Output                                            *
